// A public name that only an embedded `_restrict` formula mentions.
//
// The capitalization check harvests every public name of a translated rule
// with `universeBi ru` (Wellformedness.hs:463-483#publicNamesReport'), a
// whole-value traversal, so it reaches the source subprocess the rule carries
// in its `ruleProcess` attribute (Sapic/Facts.hs:376-388#toRule) and with it
// the `_restrict` formula's terms.  `'Foo'` therefore clashes with the
// `'foo'` of the `out`, and the report names them:
// `1. rule "Init":  name 'Foo', 'foo'`.
//
// Compared slice: the wf report block.  The `theory … end` echo agrees on
// both engines — the report is the only place the harvest is visible — so
// this row pins that block alone.  No process under tamarin-prover/examples
// carries an embedded `_restrict`, so no gate row reaches this reach.

theory SapicPubnameInRestrict
begin

predicates: P(a) <=> a = a

process:
  in(x);
  [ ] --[ Ev(x), _restrict( P('Foo') ) ]-> [ ];
  out(<'foo', x>)

end
